# Colour schemes in the terminal.
Output docs/media/tui-scheme.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 380
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 55ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "vuwr examples/products.xml" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "3"
Sleep 1.5s
Type ":scheme gruvbox-dark"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type ":scheme nord"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type ":scheme monokai"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 800ms
